(text "Bosch 0280218335 is analog 0-5 V, harness ID 1.0 k. JP2 adds a 5 V pull-up for open-collector frequency MAFs." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 105ab0c2-b2a3-4744-9e0b-64b16249d073))
